      "rules": "Required. Whole number.",
      "when": null,
      "html": "<p><strong>What it is.</strong> The employee's social security registration number.</p><p><strong>Example.</strong> 1234567</p><p><strong>Why it matters.</strong> Recorded only; payroll and reports do not read it at present.</p>",
